/* The standalone stranger-facing application is package ten in the Commons
 * graph. It uses the same row shape as zcode_package_registry.def so every
 * generic graph consumer can append it without an application-specific
 * runner. The key is a deterministic public alpha fixture identity, never an
 * owner or stable-release key. */
